The CED will advise FSA State Office of compliance and enforcement issues relating to
   rental contracts. Additional responsibilities of the COC may be delegated to the County
   Executive Director. These responsibilities include:

   a. Coordinatation with the NRCS District Conservationist or designated local NRCS
      representative;

   b. Making landowner eligibility determinations for tentatively approved easement and rental
      contract applications;

